WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:01.680
It is the period of warring states.{these top three lines were from previous ep and should not be changed or edited}{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.810
The era of competing warlords.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:10.950
Many of these daimyou clashed blades ruthlessly,
aiming for conquest of the country.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.910
Those who had lost sight of their dreams

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.320
fought battle after battle
without righteous cause.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.990
And those battles without righteous cause

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.250
would go on to sever even the
bonds that were already there.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.750
Bontenmaru!

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.880
These turbulent times grew utterly chaotic...

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.890
It will all lead up to Sekigahara.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:51.570
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.950
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.740
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.200
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.660
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.830
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.500
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.960
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.380
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:15.630
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.840
<b>So fast!</b>

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.140
<b>Break out!</b>

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:29.520
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.400
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.950
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.620
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:49.880
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.800
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.770
I imagine it will take
time for him to rally back.

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:06.730
No.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.190
We won't take any time.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:13.200
Declarations

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.460
Bontenmaru!

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:33.670
The One-Eyed Dragon isn't
a man who ends like this!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.840
That is quite a bond that they share.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.560
Kojuro, you bastard...

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.980
Shut up!

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:53.900
I'll beat that rotten attitude out of you!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.200
Remember! That day!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.830
That day?

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.370
The day of your maiden battle.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.710
Number One!

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.500
Our allies have been routed!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.260
And the enemy will be swarming us
here at headquarters before long!

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:13.380
Shit!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.970
Hold your ground!

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.840
Lord Masamune, it is time.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.350
Hell if I care!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.430
This is our maiden battle to show
that Oshu has the One-Eyed Dragon!

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.020
I'll be damned if we retreat!

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:28.940
Maiden battle or not, the commander must survive.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.310
Go straight!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.320
I'll charge ahead, ready to die!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.240
Or else, I'd never win
even the winnable battles!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.570
Have you forgotten your own position?!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:41.200
And you're fine with them not taking
the One-Eyed Dragon seriously?!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.620
I am not fine with that.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.630
Number One, please sound the retreat!

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.750
My answer is "no."

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:01.760
Protect the Number One!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.470
Yeah!

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:03.470
Yeah!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.350
Lord Masamune!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.060
No retreat!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.990
Bontenmaru!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.470
Listen well, Bontenmaru.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.850
I've never feared death.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.940
But I've never, not once,
stood on the battlefield ready to die!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:58.070
Lord Masamune,
you are the leader of this land.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.950
The burden you bear...

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.740
Look once again, with that eye of yours.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.800
You've never feared death.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:25.810
But you've never, not once, stood
on the battlefield ready to die, eh?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.690
Those were the last words of wisdom
you imparted to me as Bontenmaru.

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.920
My lord,

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.630
I will be departing for Osaka Castle now.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.640
I am a man only halfway fledged.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:09.100
Nothing has changed since that day.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.160
Wha...?!

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.870
That was dangerous!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:33.080
Still working hard, even at night, huh?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.330
It is you, Sasuke!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.750
Did you complete the mission my lord set to you?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:42.720
Yeah. Jobs should be done quickly
and reliably, that's the Sarutobi way.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.340
And that was our last job from our lord.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.850
We've been dismissed,
and you're the one we were referred to.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.640
You know, because ninjas need a master to serve.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.060
Do you speak true?!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:07:00.190
But anyone we serve had
better be a full-fledged general.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.360
It'll be my pleasure to test you!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.240
Wh-What is this all of a sudden?!

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.280
Like I said,

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:11.200
I'm going to test you to see if
you're a full-fledged general or not.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.790
If that is the case,
I will fight in earnest as well!

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.790
Please do!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.380
Body shifting?!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.930
If <i>that</i> caught you by surprise,
then you've got a long way to go.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.640
Body doubles?!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.470
Do what you will! No matter
how many opponents I face...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.180
Okay, too bad.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.600
If this were on the battlefield,
you'd be short a head.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.190
This is a problem.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:44.150
If you're no good,
we'll end up becoming masterless.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.300
There!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:08.970
Whoa!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.100
Good going there!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.970
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.560
Ah! So I passed?!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.520
Well, you're half of being full-fledged, though.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.520
Half of being full-fledged?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.730
Meaning, you're a man only half-fledged.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:28.450
The things you do are way too reckless.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.450
However, in my lord's service,

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:35.740
someday, I will become
full-fledged. You will see.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.000
That's the spirit. You keep that up.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.790
So, with that said...

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.670
Starting today, we're the Sanada Ninja Corp.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.210
Ah!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.340
<i>What I swore that day...</i>

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.970
<i>I must fulfill those words.</i>

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.890
Commander, would it be
better if I came along, too?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.220
No, I will go alone.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.470
All right.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.980
Leave things here to me while you're gone.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:02.480
<i>The tiger forges ahead
down the game trail alone.</i>

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.940
<i>Only then does he become full-fledged...</i>

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.400
That's how it goes.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.340
I have to tell my dear lady Magoichi.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:27.510
About the darkness in Ieyasu.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.340
About his sorrow...

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:34.640
Pirate!

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:39.230
Hey, there, Tsuru. This time,
<i>I</i> got to be the one waiting for <i>you</i>.

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.310
Whoa, whoa, it's not like I'm here to fight.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.610
I've got a little favor I want to ask you.

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:48.820
A favor?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:53.820
You're the shrine maiden
whose divinations often prove true?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.030
I'm begging you!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.450
Do a divination for my humble self.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.290
Figure out the whereabouts
of the key to these shackles!

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.040
Please!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.460
I am in a hurry right now.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.550
Let me pass once the
divination is done, all right?

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.590
Prithee heed me!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.640
Take that!

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.450
Huh?

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.860
Huh? What?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.620
Black feathers fluttering down,
he appears with the wind...

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.160
Truly, the first ba-dum moment.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.170
Ba-dum moment?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.710
Black feathers? Wind?

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.050
Could it be?!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.930
The encounter that was...

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:55.930
...destined to be!

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.260
The encounter that was destined to be?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.930
So where's this encounter
happen and who has it?!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.430
Hey! Come on!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.230
Hey!

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.850
You wish to hear how the
relationship began that badly?

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.360
You are making me self-conscious.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.320
But I will do it specially for you.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.450
There.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.320
This man gallantly appears,

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.160
saves the crisis, and leaves without a word!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.580
Hey, isn't this guy...

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.410
The legendary ninja!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.460
Tsuru's divinations have a reputation
for being right a lot of the time.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:29.670
Why does that Fuma have my humble self's key?!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:31.840
Wh-Why?!

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:35.380
How can I get it back?!

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.430
If I remember right,
the Hojo allied with the East, right?

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.140
Yeah.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.850
If that's how things sit,
I'll flip things back around

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.560
and use Gyobu to get the key back!

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:44.810
So long, Western Sea.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.640
I'll be going on ahead to Osaka!

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.190
W-W-Wait... Hey!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.900
Just you wait, key!

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:54.650
Oh, the man I was destined to meet...

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.910
"I"?

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.130
How is the Lady O-Ichi?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.130
She's like a ghost.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:18.260
She won't eat and she
doesn't respond when she's called.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.550
I can hardly believe she's a living being.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.600
Who are you?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.400
You are so very bright...

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.860
Lady O-Ichi, please pull yourself together.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:33.770
You must live,

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.070
or those who have followed
you will have done so for nothing.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.700
You...

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.990
Why are you covered in blood?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.990
It's as though you're my brother.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.740
What the hell did you say?!

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.040
Stop.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:59.630
Hideyoshi, was it you that changed Ieyasu?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.720
Excuse me! Please do not follow me!

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:04.100
You're walking in front of me, that's all.

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.600
You have an excuse for everything!

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:05.600
Motochika.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:09.440
Hey! I'll be damned but I never
expected to see you here, vagabond!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.770
My dear lady Magoichi!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.110
Please hear what I have to say!

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:19.530
Ieyasu is hiding something!

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:21.660
And it is something terrible!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:22.820
But...

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.780
...as to what it is, I do not know.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.410
I knew it!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.370
What?

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.870
Hey, Sayaka,

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.170
it'd feel good to have you.

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:32.290
How about it?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.210
Won't you join the western forces?
For old time's sake?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.500
If it's money, Ishida will pay!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.340
That name was discarded long ago.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.840
Motochika, why are you siding with the West?

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:46.640
Did you not have irreconcilable
differences with the Toyotomi?

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.310
People change. Like Ieyasu.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:51.730
What happened?

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.440
He took from me...

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.110
Everything!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:02.280
It can't be... For Ieyasu to do such a thing...

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.780
I have to kill him to avenge my sons-of-bitches!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.910
I won't let him get away with it!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:11.500
Why do you attribute that deed to Tokugawa?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.080
This! This is the proof!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:18.050
The bastards who attacked were flying
this banner with the wild ginger trefoil!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:21.090
And shouting, "Long live Tokugawa!"

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.300
A banner is no proof.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.050
We are mercenaries.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.140
We have the banners of every land.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.560
To lead, to divert, to maneuver...

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.890
These things are a given in war.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.610
Does this now make us a suspect as well?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.610
Then, who're you saying was behind it?!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:43.990
Ask the man himself and you will know.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.660
Or are you afraid to do that?

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.990
Right now, you look like nothing

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.620
so much as a child running away,
frightened of the truth.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.750
You say I'm running away...?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.540
Don't mess with me!

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.350
Magoichi,

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:11.680
your words always cut so deep.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.060
I'll go with you, Western Sea.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.980
No way a guy can hope to attract
the ladies if he's running away.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.940
Besides, I need to meet with Ieyasu, too.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:26.780
My dear lady...

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.490
Perhaps we will try seeing it through.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.330
Clouds are not the only things
that shut out the light of the sun.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.210
Even the hearts within men are capable of that.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.630
Tadakatsu,

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:44.380
I will remove those shadows

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.680
and create a world of
shared bonds. You will see.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.340
OSAKA  CASTLE{changed this font to look more more agressive like the sign}

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.810
Lord Hideyoshi...

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.060
Ah, tiger cub.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.610
Ye've grown to have a fine look 'bout
ya in the short while I've not seen ya.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.320
Lord Shimazu!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.780
There's somethin' Lord Shingen used to say.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:11.910
Seein' those ya can trust things to grow up...

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:16.040
That's the greatest joy there is, he said.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.130
And for <i>me</i>, it is an unlooked
for joy to hear those words.

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.790
Come to see Master Ishida, eh?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:23.800
Yes.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:28.130
Before we form an alliance, there is
something I wish to ask Master Ishida.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.840
As the general of an army.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.990
Master Ishida, I would put a question to you.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:58.000
What thoughts do you have
of the country beyond this war?

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.870
Beyond this war?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.000
I have no interest in such things.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.050
Wha...?!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.170
But were you not entrusted by Lord Hideyoshi

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:11.180
with the Toyotomi... with the country?

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:13.550
Lord Hideyoshi will determine what comes beyond.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.060
Except for Ieyasu's head,
nothing holds any value for me.

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.600
Ieyasu...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:22.600
I will carve you up cruelly,
mercilessly, hideously,

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.400
and I will kill you!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:28.740
This must not be!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:33.740
Surely, even Lord Hideyoshi
would not want this of you!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.740
Someone as lowly as you...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.870
Do not speak of Lord Hideyoshi!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.070
I lost to you once.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.690
I'll acknowledge that.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:14.530
So I have no intention of
nullifying my alliance with you.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.700
Then why are we fighting?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.620
Are you dissatisfied in
some way with our alliance?

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.790
The problem isn't you.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.420
It's <i>me</i>!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.300
So, I hate to ask this, but won't
you fight me one more time?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.930
All right!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:59.080
How could you possibly
understand anything about me?!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.080
I <i>do</i> understand!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.750
I, too, have lost and been entrusted...

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:05.960
And struggled in the water...

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.210
That is exactly why...

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.920
To become full-fledged...

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:34.950
This ends now.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.370
The Takeda are strong.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.120
That has been made amply clear.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.170
Well and good, Mitsunari?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.840
Tiger cub.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.260
Master Ishida and I are the same.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.680
If so...

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.560
<i>Because</i> it is so...

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:21.370
I never realized that
battling you was so much fun!

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:25.830
One-Eyed Dragon, you really
are an interesting man.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.790
Here goes!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.720
Crazy Storm!

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.610
Sorry for being a selfish ass,

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.780
but we're even in our alliance now.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.660
That was my intention from the very beginning.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.420
The Takeda of Kai!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.000
We are hereby with the West!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.920
The Date of Oshu!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.920
We'll be out to make a big splash!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.590
We're joining the East!

